WEBVTT

00:00:02.461 --> 00:00:07.842
Powerful warrior... My master...

00:00:15.892 --> 00:00:17.727
Let's get 905F19-

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:50.009
<i>Now set free</i>

00:00:50.218 --> 00:00:56.390
<i>Your hidden feelings</i>

00:00:56.599 --> 00:01:00.269
<i>So that you may sever</i>

00:01:00.478 --> 00:01:06.150
<i>Reality that returns to nothingness</i>

00:01:06.359 --> 00:01:08.861
<i>Even if fate is inevitable</i>

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:11.489
<i>Nobody can predict what will happen</i>

00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:14.033
<i>Defy it with all you've got</i>

00:01:14.242 --> 00:01:18.913
<i>Grasp the future reflected in</i>

00:01:19.121 --> 00:01:21.457
<i>Your eyes with your own hands</i>

00:01:21.666 --> 00:01:24.126
<i>Shout out</i>

00:01:24.335 --> 00:01:26.754
<i>Your existence</i>

00:01:26.963 --> 00:01:31.842
<i>Cry out</i>

00:01:32.051 --> 00:01:34.262
<i>Shout out</i>

00:01:34.637 --> 00:01:37.014
<i>Shout out</i>

00:01:37.223 --> 00:01:39.600
<i>No matter what hardship</i>

00:01:39.809 --> 00:01:47.650
<i>Awaits us down the way</i>

00:01:47.858 --> 00:01:54.240
<i>Light my fire</i>

00:02:19.307 --> 00:02:20.516
Those are...

00:02:20.725 --> 00:02:21.726
Indeed.

00:02:21.934 --> 00:02:25.104
The ancient Flame Hazes,

00:02:25.313 --> 00:02:29.525
dragged down with me,
when I was imprisoned here.

00:02:29.734 --> 00:02:31.569
It has been thousands of years.

00:02:31.777 --> 00:02:34.405
I'm amazed they retain sentience.

00:02:34.613 --> 00:02:37.366
Their devotion is impressive.

00:02:37.575 --> 00:02:38.701
Quite so.

00:02:38.909 --> 00:02:41.579
We must offer them some respect,

00:02:41.787 --> 00:02:45.249
even should it delay our journey.

00:02:45.458 --> 00:02:48.127
But they will allow us passage.

00:02:55.301 --> 00:02:57.845
Because this path leads to the means

00:02:58.054 --> 00:03:00.389
by which the fates of
Shana and the Flame Hazes,

00:03:00.598 --> 00:03:03.559
as well as the world's
structure may all be changed!

00:03:09.231 --> 00:03:10.483
Out of my way.

00:03:10.691 --> 00:03:12.651
I have to go.

00:03:22.453 --> 00:03:23.871
Aster.

00:03:36.092 --> 00:03:39.387
Hecate, you head for the safe zone first.

00:03:39.595 --> 00:03:42.139
Guide the rest of us when we withdraw.

00:03:42.348 --> 00:03:43.849
Understood.

00:03:48.104 --> 00:03:48.771
Domino!

00:03:48.979 --> 00:03:51.148
Yes, Sir!

00:03:51.357 --> 00:03:55.653
Professor, you can gather data later.

00:03:55.861 --> 00:03:59.198
What a treasure mother lode!

00:03:59.407 --> 00:04:00.074
Yes, yes...

00:04:00.282 --> 00:04:00.908
--Let's go.

00:04:01.117 --> 00:04:02.701
--All of this is
--Let's go.

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:06.956
My food, my water, my very life!

00:04:11.335 --> 00:04:13.212
Should we assist?

00:04:14.171 --> 00:04:15.965
You think they require it?

00:04:16.173 --> 00:04:18.467
Tartaros: Isolate.

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:27.393
You're never any fun.

00:04:29.812 --> 00:04:32.815
"Crossing"

00:04:35.693 --> 00:04:40.072
So, contact with the Fortress
Commander has been lost...

00:04:40.281 --> 00:04:45.202
Now, there is no way to keep
the Divine Gate concealed.

00:04:45.411 --> 00:04:48.789
We should assume the
enemy will soon launch an attack.

00:04:50.082 --> 00:04:55.880
But where did the intruders come from?

00:05:11.312 --> 00:05:14.565
I have to tell everyone about the Divine Gate!

00:05:24.575 --> 00:05:26.619
What is this?

00:05:26.827 --> 00:05:29.788
It looks like the
Palace of Heaven's Road.

00:05:37.087 --> 00:05:38.881
This is...

00:05:39.089 --> 00:05:40.925
...Ball Masque's...

00:05:42.927 --> 00:05:45.054
Do you like it,

00:05:45.262 --> 00:05:46.889
princess?

00:05:50.935 --> 00:05:53.771
It's fine for you to explore the castle,

00:05:53.979 --> 00:05:58.108
but why are you alone,
without your attendants?

00:05:58.317 --> 00:06:03.864
And you appear to have
broken the bonds of Tartaros.

00:06:04.073 --> 00:06:05.699
I have yet to introduce myself.

00:06:05.908 --> 00:06:10.371
I am Uvall, the Chaotic Beat
of Burdening Drums.

00:06:10.579 --> 00:06:13.123
While I feel foolish, naming myself so,

00:06:13.332 --> 00:06:16.043
lam a Crimson Lord.

00:06:16.252 --> 00:06:21.340
Presently, my mission is to
search for intruders.

00:06:21.549 --> 00:06:24.385
Will you tell me who,

00:06:24.593 --> 00:06:26.845
exactly, you might be, princess?

00:06:32.268 --> 00:06:33.894
I am...

00:06:36.647 --> 00:06:39.191
...the Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer,

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.026
Shana.

00:06:41.944 --> 00:06:44.947
A Flame Haze, is it?

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:48.534
Then if I'm forced to get a little rough,

00:06:48.742 --> 00:06:51.078
you can hardly complain!

00:06:54.039 --> 00:06:55.082
M)' apologies.

00:06:55.291 --> 00:06:58.752
I'd rather not see this room damaged.

00:06:58.961 --> 00:07:00.963
What's wrong?

00:07:01.171 --> 00:07:03.257
Surely, in the few
days since your capture,

00:07:03.465 --> 00:07:06.635
you haven't forgotten how to fight.

00:07:09.138 --> 00:07:11.056
I don't know...

00:07:13.976 --> 00:07:17.313
Let us find out.

00:07:18.981 --> 00:07:21.692
Such weak words...

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:27.781
As the situation is urgent,
I haven't the time to be gentle.

00:07:36.749 --> 00:07:38.459
We've gone quite deep,

00:07:38.667 --> 00:07:42.546
but have yet to find any
prisons that could hold her, indeed.

00:07:42.755 --> 00:07:44.340
Continue search.

00:07:44.548 --> 00:07:45.466
Of course.

00:07:45.674 --> 00:07:46.800
Given the fighting,

00:07:47.009 --> 00:07:49.970
that Mystes would take care to
hide her deep within the castle.

00:07:50.179 --> 00:07:53.182
If they were going to hold her,
they would hold her somewhere...

00:08:09.907 --> 00:08:12.117
This is the Crystal Altar.

00:08:12.326 --> 00:08:15.579
But why... Why is it still...

00:08:15.788 --> 00:08:17.414
inexplicable.

00:08:19.667 --> 00:08:21.669
You shouldn't touch it.

00:08:23.545 --> 00:08:27.299
Do so, and they'll know you were here,
Specialist of Everything.

00:08:27.508 --> 00:08:30.928
It's been a long time, Spiral Organ.

00:08:43.023 --> 00:08:45.025
Synchronization complete.

00:08:53.742 --> 00:08:57.121
Yeah, their attacks seem more vigorous.

00:08:57.329 --> 00:08:58.205
Mm...

00:08:58.414 --> 00:09:00.165
With the Crypta destroyed,

00:09:00.374 --> 00:09:04.545
they need no longer worry about
damaging the fortress.

00:09:04.753 --> 00:09:05.587
Yeah.

00:09:05.796 --> 00:09:09.591
Then the question is
whether we remain here?

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:10.634
Hmm...

00:09:10.843 --> 00:09:12.636
It would be unwise

00:09:12.845 --> 00:09:16.348
to overlook that
unknown object up there.

00:09:16.557 --> 00:09:19.601
But far worse to
attack without identifying it.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:20.602
Yeah...

00:09:20.811 --> 00:09:25.899
Then until the Specialist of Everything rescues
the Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer...

00:09:28.277 --> 00:09:29.403
...we continue to fight.

00:09:29.611 --> 00:09:31.029
Set's Wheel.

00:09:31.238 --> 00:09:33.240
Deploy Qadesh's Blood Seal.

00:09:33.449 --> 00:09:34.992
Activate... Deploying.

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:38.203
Synchronizing to Qadesh's Blood Pulse.

00:09:43.834 --> 00:09:45.711
Those old guys are kicking butt!

00:09:45.919 --> 00:09:49.673
Are you certain you needn't
return to the troops you lead,

00:09:49.882 --> 00:09:52.342
Purson, the Majestic
Lion's Bellowing Call?

00:09:52.551 --> 00:09:53.886
I see...

00:09:54.094 --> 00:09:56.930
Its destructive power is indeed awesome.

00:09:57.139 --> 00:09:58.932
But were you there,

00:09:59.141 --> 00:10:01.143
you could have targeted
them more effectively.

00:10:01.351 --> 00:10:05.230
That is why I've asked you
to accompany me in this dance.

00:10:05.439 --> 00:10:06.732
Thanks very much.

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:10.319
Don't scream if I tread on your foot!

00:10:10.527 --> 00:10:13.781
The old man's too big
to dodge this guy's attack.

00:10:13.989 --> 00:10:16.283
That's why I lured him here.

00:10:16.492 --> 00:10:19.578
But was he baiting me instead?

00:10:19.787 --> 00:10:24.249
Indeed, you never should have
tried respect for your elders.

00:10:24.458 --> 00:10:25.584
It doesn't matter.

00:10:25.793 --> 00:10:30.839
Any problem can be solved by
making the enemy explode.

00:10:31.048 --> 00:10:35.010
I see, you speak the truth.

00:10:35.219 --> 00:10:40.474
One I shall obey, as well.

00:10:40.682 --> 00:10:43.101
With my Unrestricted Method, Fanfare!

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:45.604
May you enjoy it.

00:10:49.233 --> 00:10:50.234
Play...

00:10:50.442 --> 00:10:52.444
Fanfare!

00:10:55.197 --> 00:10:56.323
Not bad.

00:10:56.532 --> 00:11:00.285
You're the first to avoid a
single hit from those.

00:11:00.494 --> 00:11:02.538
I am honored.

00:11:13.966 --> 00:11:16.218
I never expected the Spiral Organ

00:11:16.426 --> 00:11:21.056
to provide so much excellent information,
including our present location.

00:11:21.265 --> 00:11:22.850
Excellent indeed.

00:11:23.308 --> 00:11:25.143
And a trade...

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:33.527
I would ask that you stay out
of the organization's

00:11:33.735 --> 00:11:36.154
central area, up ahead.

00:11:40.534 --> 00:11:43.036
If you refuse,

00:11:43.245 --> 00:11:48.458
I shall be forced to fight you,
on Ball Masque's behalf.

00:11:48.667 --> 00:11:50.878
I shall agree.

00:11:51.086 --> 00:11:55.507
We do not believe that cooperation
with Ball Masque, to further your own ends,

00:11:55.716 --> 00:11:58.260
constitutes betrayal.

00:11:58.468 --> 00:12:01.346
However, should you stand in my way,

00:12:01.555 --> 00:12:03.515
I shall be forced to eliminate you, indeed.

00:12:03.724 --> 00:12:05.017
I understand.

00:12:05.225 --> 00:12:08.520
Thus, I would like to
persuade you to go elsewhere.

00:12:08.729 --> 00:12:10.272
Persuade?

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:13.734
I can offer you two things.

00:12:13.942 --> 00:12:17.571
The first is information.

00:12:17.779 --> 00:12:19.615
And the other?

00:12:21.575 --> 00:12:25.996
Thanks to him, we were able to
verify her safety, indeed.

00:12:26.204 --> 00:12:28.832
The Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer...

00:12:29.041 --> 00:12:31.835
She escaped safely without my aid.

00:12:32.044 --> 00:12:33.545
Unpredictable.

00:12:33.754 --> 00:12:37.633
That our attack created an
opening for her is certain, indeed.

00:12:37.841 --> 00:12:42.304
But I believe that, left alone,
she would have been fine.

00:12:42.512 --> 00:12:44.348
Cease worry.

00:12:46.224 --> 00:12:48.393
I know that, indeed.

00:12:48.602 --> 00:12:53.523
I am only upset

00:12:53.732 --> 00:12:58.362
because she didn't require my help.

00:13:00.364 --> 00:13:02.324
I just cannot believe...

00:13:02.532 --> 00:13:04.743
Adjust mood.

00:13:04.952 --> 00:13:09.081
Truly, my task now is to not worry.

00:13:09.289 --> 00:13:12.584
But to wait here for
the time to strike, indeed.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:15.754
And one additional thing...

00:13:15.963 --> 00:13:17.839
To watch over her.

00:13:18.048 --> 00:13:21.551
She has begun her battle, indeed.

00:13:38.527 --> 00:13:42.364
You are indeed worthy of the
God of Atonement's contract,

00:13:42.572 --> 00:13:45.117
and the master's attention.

00:13:45.325 --> 00:13:46.368
Is this it?

00:13:46.576 --> 00:13:49.788
No, it isn't this.

00:13:49.997 --> 00:13:52.874
I shall exercise still greater
caution in this fight.

00:13:54.042 --> 00:13:56.420
This is just like it's always been.

00:13:56.628 --> 00:13:58.005
Something should lie ahead...

00:13:58.213 --> 00:14:00.674
A power even more vast...

00:14:16.356 --> 00:14:19.526
The Crypta's collapse continues apace.

00:14:19.735 --> 00:14:21.403
We should assume the
Flame Hazes are aware

00:14:21.611 --> 00:14:24.781
of the Palace of the Stars' location.

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:28.076
No, the castle has already been invaded.

00:14:28.285 --> 00:14:30.412
Our location stands revealed.

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:35.542
Meaning that Sophie Sawallisch will...

00:14:37.252 --> 00:14:39.212
Emergency message.

00:14:39.421 --> 00:14:41.590
Respond, regardless of present circumstance.

00:14:41.798 --> 00:14:45.886
Dashing Earthly Fiend Ribesal,
Commander of the Eastern Theater Forces.

00:14:46.094 --> 00:14:50.307
Burning Agitation Haborym,
Commander of the Western Theater Forces.

00:14:50.515 --> 00:14:52.934
I hear you. What is it?

00:14:53.143 --> 00:14:55.520
What do you need, Supreme Commander?

00:14:55.729 --> 00:14:59.733
Cease all combat, and return
to the Palace of the Stars.

00:14:59.941 --> 00:15:03.028
It's probable that the
Braider of Trembling Might leads

00:15:03.236 --> 00:15:06.364
the bulk of the enemy forces,
in a surprise attack.

00:15:06.573 --> 00:15:07.657
What?

00:15:07.866 --> 00:15:09.826
I request an explanation.

00:15:10.035 --> 00:15:12.537
I shall brief you fully later.

00:15:12.746 --> 00:15:15.957
First, issue the withdrawal order to all troops.

00:15:16.166 --> 00:15:18.001
Understood.

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:21.838
The Palace of the Stars' perimeter

00:15:22.047 --> 00:15:26.843
is riddled with scouts
and Unrestricted Methods.

00:15:27.052 --> 00:15:30.097
They will not be permitted to approach.

00:15:35.185 --> 00:15:37.104
It's almost time.

00:15:37.312 --> 00:15:38.730
Yes.

00:15:39.689 --> 00:15:43.568
Captain, I'm sorry to keep asking,
but is anything out of sorts?

00:15:43.777 --> 00:15:45.195
Nothing.

00:15:45.403 --> 00:15:49.074
No signals from this
area have been received

00:15:49.282 --> 00:15:52.119
that would require a
reevaluation of Operation Calm.

00:15:52.327 --> 00:15:54.412
We won't let that happen.

00:15:54.621 --> 00:15:57.833
We'll show you what humans are capable of.

00:15:58.041 --> 00:15:59.042
I'm certain you will.

00:15:59.251 --> 00:16:02.838
Today, we shall
depend on humanity's might.

00:16:03.046 --> 00:16:06.133
I'm sure the surrounding
radar facilities' Seals

00:16:06.341 --> 00:16:08.385
have been completed by now.

00:16:08.593 --> 00:16:12.264
We won't leave any
traces of this operation.

00:16:13.348 --> 00:16:15.892
I see no problems in our final check.

00:16:16.101 --> 00:16:17.769
Along the rendezvous route,

00:16:17.978 --> 00:16:20.939
I see nothing to indicate
any sudden weather changes.

00:16:21.148 --> 00:16:22.816
Thank you, Frangois.

00:16:23.024 --> 00:16:24.067
This operation would

00:16:24.276 --> 00:16:29.573
have been impossible without
your perfect weather predictions.

00:16:29.781 --> 00:16:31.950
Those, along with the coordinates
the Specialist of Everything calculated

00:16:32.159 --> 00:16:34.161
from the Midnight Lost Child's information.

00:16:34.369 --> 00:16:37.539
We cannot waste anything.

00:16:37.747 --> 00:16:42.043
Commander Sawallisch,
we're three minutes from the drop point.

00:16:42.252 --> 00:16:44.337
Thank you, Captain.

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:50.177
Everyone! The time is at hand.

00:16:50.385 --> 00:16:52.012
The operation's success

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:57.017
depends on our ability to end all combat
before enemy reinforcements arrive.

00:16:57.225 --> 00:17:00.687
I wish to use this battle's absolute success

00:17:00.896 --> 00:17:03.857
as an example for future Flame Hazes,

00:17:04.065 --> 00:17:05.901
and as a warning to the Denizens

00:17:06.109 --> 00:17:10.780
against initiating any
large-scale battles in the future.

00:17:10.989 --> 00:17:14.492
Thus, I must ask
that you not embarrass us

00:17:14.701 --> 00:17:17.537
with failure at the start.

00:17:20.582 --> 00:17:23.877
We now commence Operation Crossing.

00:17:31.092 --> 00:17:32.636
More hide-and-seek?

00:17:32.844 --> 00:17:35.889
Jeez. We can't waste time here.

00:17:36.097 --> 00:17:37.807
I'm sure he feels the same.

00:17:38.016 --> 00:17:41.978
Well, we'll soon figure out his location.

00:17:44.356 --> 00:17:45.774
There!

00:17:51.863 --> 00:17:53.865
No! To the right!

00:17:58.787 --> 00:18:00.914
A bluff? Damn!

00:18:01.915 --> 00:18:05.085
I'm impressed you were
able to defend so quickly.

00:18:05.293 --> 00:18:06.795
However...

00:18:07.003 --> 00:18:08.088
It's no good.

00:18:08.296 --> 00:18:10.382
It won't be in time...

00:18:14.594 --> 00:18:15.887
That sound is nearby!

00:18:16.096 --> 00:18:17.889
Why all the way out here?

00:18:18.098 --> 00:18:20.183
And so many?!

00:18:21.309 --> 00:18:23.144
It's begun!

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:47.002
An entire army, transported by air?

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:51.756
I didn't anticipate so many forces
in a single area simultaneously.

00:18:51.965 --> 00:18:53.967
We must hurry and counterattack.

00:18:55.885 --> 00:18:58.179
Now what is it?

00:19:03.685 --> 00:19:06.646
N-No! If we descend now...

00:19:26.666 --> 00:19:28.501
Bye!

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:21.096
The Braider of Trembling Might,
Sophie Sawallisch.

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:28.186
It seems the Palace of the Stars was
brought down with perfect timing, indeed.

00:20:28.395 --> 00:20:30.230
Opening created.

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:35.819
Then, let us go to her, indeed.

00:20:38.405 --> 00:20:40.156
What is she?

00:20:40.365 --> 00:20:42.700
With every fight, she gets stronger!

00:20:44.327 --> 00:20:46.037
I can't keep up...

00:20:47.372 --> 00:20:51.084
Am I being sacrificed to the dark god?

00:20:57.799 --> 00:20:59.509
Still not enough.

00:20:59.717 --> 00:21:03.346
I must recall the very
basics of using my power.

00:21:04.514 --> 00:21:06.307
Alastor...

00:21:06.516 --> 00:21:11.646
A Flame Haze's power derives from
the image of strength the contractor holds,

00:21:11.646 --> 00:21:13.940
<i>I must be dreaming tonight</i>

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:15.984
and from its fusion
with the Crimson Lord's power.

00:21:15.984 --> 00:21:19.362
<i>We erase it from our memories</i>

00:21:19.362 --> 00:21:19.487
Thus, to avoid
unnecessary preconceptions,

00:21:19.571 --> 00:21:21.364
<i>You can't escape</i>

00:21:21.364 --> 00:21:25.034
the Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer
is not given a specific fighting style.

00:21:25.034 --> 00:21:26.744
<i>I only know this secret with you</i>

00:21:26.744 --> 00:21:30.331
What is the Flame-Haired
Burning-Eyed Slayer's relation to me?

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:33.168
The Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer is...

00:21:33.168 --> 00:21:38.673
<i>Without you by my side</i>

00:21:38.673 --> 00:21:39.632
Then, what does strength mean to me?

00:21:39.841 --> 00:21:43.303
What should symbolize my power?

00:21:43.303 --> 00:21:45.388
<i>"I'll believe..."</i>

00:21:45.472 --> 00:21:49.017
I'm going to be devoured by
the God of Atonement's contractor!

00:21:49.225 --> 00:21:51.352
Right now, I am...

00:21:54.314 --> 00:21:55.398
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:21:55.607 --> 00:21:57.275
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:21:57.484 --> 00:22:01.070
<i>“I'll believe..." Even in
the fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:01.154 --> 00:22:02.197
That's right.

00:22:02.197 --> 00:22:04.282
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:22:04.282 --> 00:22:04.782
A strong me...

00:22:04.782 --> 00:22:07.535
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:22:07.744 --> 00:22:10.705
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:22:10.914 --> 00:22:14.292
<i>ls also inside of me, then...</i>

00:22:14.501 --> 00:22:17.462
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:22:17.462 --> 00:22:17.754
Soaring Flame!

00:22:17.754 --> 00:22:23.426
<i>It is the reason why
I continue to exist</i>

00:22:23.635 --> 00:22:24.719
<i>Inside of Kaos I say</i>

00:22:24.928 --> 00:22:28.264
<i>How can I make you
know my heart is with you hey?</i>

00:22:28.264 --> 00:22:28.389
Conviction!

00:22:28.473 --> 00:22:31.684
<i>All people, everyone,
forget things,</i>

00:22:31.893 --> 00:22:35.063
<i>Even their aching scars</i>

00:22:35.271 --> 00:22:38.399
<i>Each time I see the passage of time,</i>

00:22:38.608 --> 00:22:41.778
<i>These emotions fade</i>

00:22:41.986 --> 00:22:45.698
<i>But I don't want to
overlook things any longer</i>

00:22:45.907 --> 00:22:48.618
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:22:48.826 --> 00:22:56.876
<i>The vanishing afterimage, that is you
in and of itself (So now that you & I)</i>

00:22:57.085 --> 00:22:58.127
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:22:58.336 --> 00:23:00.088
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:23:00.296 --> 00:23:03.716
<i>“I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:23:03.925 --> 00:23:07.053
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:23:07.053 --> 00:23:08.680
I have come here for you, indeed.

00:23:08.680 --> 00:23:10.473
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:23:10.473 --> 00:23:11.224
Joyous reunion.

00:23:11.224 --> 00:23:13.518
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:13.726 --> 00:23:17.272
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:17.480 --> 00:23:20.400
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:20.608 --> 00:23:29.117
<i>“I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist, (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:23:29.200 --> 00:23:31.035
<i>Yum...</i>

00:23:33.079 --> 00:23:36.916
Operation Crossing's success gives
the Flame Hazes the advantage.

00:23:37.125 --> 00:23:42.505
Decarabia appears on the
battlefield, hoping to turn the tide.

00:23:42.714 --> 00:23:44.882
Next time, on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:45.091 --> 00:23:46.884
"Feelings Heard."
